1.what is PowerBI
  PowerBi is a data visuvalisation and  Business Intelligence tool used to analyze data and create Interactive reports
  It was developed by Microsoft
  it helps to # analyze data
              create reports
              build dashboards
              find business insights

2.why do we use PowerBi
  we use PowerBi to convert rawdata into meaningful insights using charts and dashboards

3.why companies use PowerBi
  To track sales
  Monitor profit
  Analyze employment performance
  understand customer behaviour

4.what are the main components of PowerBi
  1.PowerBi Desktop
    used to # Import data
              clean data
              create reports
  2.PowerBi Service
    used to # publish reports
              share dashboards
  3.PowerBi Mobile
    used to view reports anywhere

