6.what is Report and Dashboard and explain its differnces
REPORT:
Detailed collection of data visuvalisation, means not real time data
DASHBOARD:
Real tiem data or summary view of business perfoemance
DIFFERENCE:
     Report                                   Dashboard
Not realtime data                           Realtime data
Detailed collection of data                 Quick Summary view 
Multiple pages                              Single page
More Interactive                            Simple and quick
Create reports in pbi Desktop               publish at pbi service
Shows complete info                         Shows only importants points


